cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Mediator, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: Mediator
abstract: >-
  A self-hosted media server in one Go binary with its web app embedded:
  it indexes video, music and pictures, including the contents of RAR and ZIP
  sets and DVD images, streams them to any browser with on-the-fly conversion
  and HLS, plays them on DLNA televisions, and analyses how music sounds to
  find similar tracks.
authors:
  - given-names: Johan
    family-names: Lindvall
repository-code: "https://github.com/JohanLindvall/Mediator"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-06"
keywords:
  - media server
  - self-hosted
  - video streaming
  - HLS
  - DLNA
  - ffmpeg
  - music
  - Go
